Changes made by this fork
-------------------------
The engine is vendored into `pi-ultrasearch` so that engine behaviour can be
changed and tested in-tree. Modifications to upstream source are behavioural
(additive protocol fields, security filtering, metrics and budgets) and are
listed in `docs/engine-changes.md`. The vendored `LICENSE` and the copyright
notice above are kept intact; the MIT terms permit modification and
redistribution provided the copyright notice and permission notice are
retained.

What is *not* vendored
----------------------
`target/` (build output), `.git/`, and `.cargo/` are excluded. Build with
`cargo build --release`; see `BUILD.md`.
